    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68028" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθ-ωτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for letting out</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ μισθωτική,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθαρνητική</span>
			, <i>mercenary trade</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				346b
			</span></i>; <i>connected with letting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράπεζα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					3.932.2
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1695.36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθωτικόν, τό</span>, <i>contribution</i> in money or kind
				<i>made by a tenant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				85.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.88.26
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
